forge (1.0.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.0.1: the git merge driver (forge merge-file) now
    chooses the format handler by the file's real path, so git merge reaches
    semantic handlers and no longer writes conflict markers into binary
    files.

